      {
        "author_name": "Adam Hunter",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111469366046981798161/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUwBZn7YW5ANSTF-eeY_u74pqYvLu6BiIl_4LvYFN_gwe2ptRjoEg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "I was travelling through Montreal on the way to Saskatoon on some less-than-desirable summer tires. One of my old tires gave out and I knew I should replace all 4 before my trek across the country. Pneus Mobile Pit-Stop were able to not only source brand new tires (for an excellent price) but were very timely in coming to install at a near moment’s notice. My tire had popped at 12pm on Thursday and by 12pm on Friday I had a brand-new set installed in the driveway of the place I was staying. Excellent fast, friendly, and efficient service!!! Cannot recommend enough!",
        "time": 1683301294,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Victoria T",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108734803267195804087/reviews",
